{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHFmwRQg5PGGpHW2Yyn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n*condition :: constraint :: cut*\n\n---\n\n```\nش ر ط\n│ │ │\n╰─┼─╯\n  │\n  ▼\nstipulation\n```\n\n---\n\nThe root speaks of **incision** — \n\nto make a mark upon flesh\nto draw a line that binds\nto carve terms into reality\n\n---\n\n**Arabic شَرْط** → condition, prerequisite, that which must be\n**Hebrew שרט** → to scratch, to score, to incise\n\n---\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│  if_then            │\n│  ├── requirement    │\n│  ├── covenant       │\n│  └── wound          │\n└─────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n*The condition cuts both ways:*\n*it binds the promiser*\n*it marks the promised*\n\n---\n\nط / ט\n\nthe serpent coiled\nat the end of terms\n\n---"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":243,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}